<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was quiet late Friday. There were no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed at the close.</p>
<p>Inquiry and demand were light. Sales confirmed last week on 107,100 head including 27,100 head or about 25 percent previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>confirmed: none    last week: 1500	last year: 37700</p>
</text>
